title: 'session: fix benchmarks with non-zero KeyDeposit'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `pallet_session::Pallet::ensure_can_pay_key_deposit` now mints the key deposit on top of the
    account's existing balance. Previously it counted existing free balance towards the deposit, so
    the key hold consumed funds the benchmark set up for other purposes. This made the
    `pallet-collator-selection` `register_as_candidate` and `take_candidate_slot` benchmarks fail on
    runtimes with a non-zero session `KeyDeposit`.
crates:
- name: pallet-session
  bump: patch
- name: pallet-collator-selection
  bump: patch
